ic speech on the platform gab  CEO said the platform cooperates with  law enforcement to ensure that anyone  who would abuse our site harm anyone or  make terroristic threats is brought to  Justice the law says that social media  companies aren't responsible for the  content it's users post some of these  platforms are also increasingly backed  by prominent conservatives former  president Donald Trump launched his own  social network called Truth social after  Twitter borrowed him from the platform  following the January 6 attack at the  Capitol Google recently approved truth  social for distribution in its mobile  app store opening a new potential  customer base for the startup app in  2021 the alternative video platform  Rumble said it was expecting an  investment from a group of prominent  conservative Venture capitalists this  included Peter Thiel and hillbilly elegy  author JD Vance and Elon Musk the  world's wealthiest person recently  completed his takeover of Twitter with  plans to loosen its moderation controls  at a Ted conference in April he said  well I think it's very important for  uh there to be an inclusive arena for  free speech looking ahead for West The  Parlor deal is expected to close later  this year in a press statement parlor's  CEOs said the acquisition would change  the way the world thinks about Free  Speech despite high profile backers data  suggests that the alternative social  platforms have struggled to gain  traction with a wide audience in  September parlor said it had more than  16 million registered users by  comparison Twitter has more than 230  million users on the platform each day  meanwhile a recent study by the Pew  Research Center found that fewer than 1  in 10 Americans read alternative social  media sites for news the study also  found that 15 percent of prominent  accounts on alternative social media  sites have been banned or demonetized  elsewhere on the internet While most  alternative social media apps don't have  as 